  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe current 3rd person view does not work well with the new debug UI:\n\n- Trying to scroll on it moves the 3rd person camera closer / further away\n\n- Local Movement sticks to the players head and not the camera\n\n- Holding Tab to move the cursor enables / disabled free look\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe debug UI (at least in local movement mode) should behave like the main menu does:\n\n- Scrolling should not affect 3rd person mode when hovering over the debug UI\n\n- It should stick to the actual camera and not the player head\n\n- Holding Tab should not enable free look while the debug UI is open / looked at\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/bnqC2rlRf7g",
